cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this app, please cite it and the works it builds on, listed under references.
type: software
title: eeg-spectral
abstract: Spectral biomarkers of clinical scalp EEG (routine and long-term video-EEG), one step of the Scalp EEG
  Interictal Biomarkers workflow. Welch power spectra (MNE-Python, 4 s Hamming windows, 50% overlap) of the
  artifact-free EEG outside seizures; absolute, relative and log band power; aperiodic exponent and offset and
  oscillatory peaks with specparam (FOOOF); the posterior dominant rhythm (frequency, amplitude, left-right
  asymmetry, reactivity) after Lodder and van Putten 2011; the revised Brain Symmetry Index (van Putten 2007) per
  homologous pair and band; theta/alpha and (delta+theta)/(alpha+beta) slowing ratios; a shared long feature table.
  Works on referential and bipolar-only recordings. Research outputs, to be reviewed by a clinician.
